            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lin Z"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been making this sauce for years. Perfect for burgers, sandwiches, and dip for fresh veggies. And, of course, best Thousand Island salad dressing ever, way better than any store-bought. The only change that I make is to use dill pickle relish as it's already chopped perfectly. If it's not dilly enough I add fresh or dried dill.",
            "datePublished": "2025-08-31T01:53:57.634Z"
